      "content": "**Bug Report: Primary Issue: Checkout Process Failure**\n\n**User Details:**\n- Device: MacBook Pro\n- Browser: Chrome\n- Platform: MacOS\n\n**Issue Description:**\n- Multiple attempts to 'pay now' stuck during checkout\n- System pauses briefly, then the next attempt starts without progressing\n- Entire screen turns white after repeated on 'pay now' button clicks\n- Confirmation email not received\n- Bank application shows pending status\n- The website shows nothing has occurred\n- This issue recurs with every saved card attempted to be used\n\n**Steps to Reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to checkout page\n2. Click on 'pay now' button repeatedly (up to three times; as observed)\n3. Observe the screen turn completely white during each click attempt\n4. Check bank app to verify that the transaction is ongoing\n5. Verify no confirmation email arrives\n6. Using 'save card' feature and encounter same issue\n\n**Recommended Actions:**\n- Thoroughly investigate the checkout process\n- Investigate underlying cause of the browser lag and rendering issues\n- Address the lack of notifications to clients about pending transactions\n- Fix error to ensure reliable processing and successful payment notifications upon a saved card usage\n\n**",
